    "Practical Clothing": "Aprons; Oven mitts; Hair scarves; Hair ties",
    "Other/Misc": "Lace; Floral and gingham patterns; Soft blues, reds, pinks, greens, and yellows; Embroidered clothes with things like plants, fruits, and insects; Things with big pockets"
